    "title": "College Football Bowl Game Results",
    "text": "•   **Cotton Bowl:** No. 10 Miami defeated No. 3 Ohio State 24-14.\n•   Ohio State's Jeremiah Smith had 157 receiving yards and a touchdown.\n•   Miami's Keionte Scott had a 72-yard interception return for a touchdown.\n•   **Citrus Bowl:** No. 14 Texas defeated No. 18 Michigan 41-27.\n•   Texas' Arch Manning threw for 221 yards and two touchdowns, and ran for 155 yards and a touchdown.\n•   Michigan's Bryce Underwood threw for 199 yards, two touchdowns, and three interceptions.\n•   **Reliaquest Bowl:** Iowa defeated No. 13 Vanderbilt 34-27.\n•   Iowa's Mark Gronowski threw for two touchdowns and rushed for another.\n•   Vanderbilt's Diego Pavia threw for 347 yards.\n•   **Las Vegas Bowl:** No. 15 Utah defeated Nebraska 44-22.\n•   Utah's Devon Dampier threw for 310 yards and two touchdowns, and ran for 148 yards and three touchdowns.\n•   **Sun Bowl:** Duke defeated Arizona State 42-39.\n•   Duke's Darian Mensah threw for 327 yards and four touchdowns.\n•   Arizona State's Jeff Sims threw for 375 yards and three touchdowns, and ran for 70 yards and two touchdowns.",
